The '''Jungle''' is a randomly-generated location in the [[Crystal Hollows]]. The [[Jungle Temple]] spawns in a random location inside. [[Sludge]]s and [[Kalhuiki Tribe Member]]s can be found there, while [[Abyssal Miner]]s can be fished up in the area.

